  "kind": "effect",
  "description": "A stereo chorus insert for a track (a WIDENS effect, ABI 1.12): one delay line of the mid, two taps that swing in opposite directions around the Delay, one to the left and one to the right, so a mono sound gets a stereo image and a stereo voice keeps its own. Period, Depth, Delay and Mix; four factory presets. A stereo effect needs OS-INSFX-ABI2 A4 on the unit.",
